/T (The Department of Computer Science and Design organized an industrial visit to the SOIS Lab, Innovation Centre, and Cybersecurity Centre at MAHE on June 21, 2024, under the theme "Exploring Options for Entrepreneurship - Discussion with Startup Ecosystem Enablers." A total of 62 third-year CSD students participated. Students had an enriching experience, gaining valuable insights into the forefront of technological and scientific development. The event was coordinated by Mrs. Chatura V. Karadesai, Assistant Professor, Department of CSD in association with Mrs. Ashwini Holla V R and IEEE Canara Students Branch.)
